WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.600
Two numbers. One rapid stream. Which will you remember?

00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:13.300
The first target catches your attention. The next arrives just afterward.

00:00:13.300 --> 00:00:20.000
At certain delays, people may miss the second target—even while looking at the screen.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:26.600
Change the timing or instructions, and the missing target may reappear in reports.

00:00:26.600 --> 00:00:33.300
Months of intensive meditation training changed a laboratory measure in one small study. That is not proof of any audio product.

00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:40.000
Perception is evidence. Explanation takes another step. Explore the sources at Final Vestige.
